WEBVTT

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.020
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:22.930
We have to find the ring
before Adele does!

00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:26.640
Agnes doesn't want the Brigadoon Project!

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:30.830
What do you...
What do you know of witches?!

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:38.290
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:41.170
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:44.970
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

