00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.550
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.550
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:26.550
Find it!

00:02:27.150 --> 00:02:28.970
The ring is near here!

00:02:28.970 --> 00:02:29.990
Yes!

00:02:31.530 --> 00:02:36.120
We have to find it before Agnes does.

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:40.270
Everyone, split up and search!

00:02:40.270 --> 00:02:43.860
We have to find the ring
before Adele does!

00:02:46.860 --> 00:02:49.870
Man, it's late.

00:02:49.870 --> 00:02:54.010
Mom's probably pretty angry.

00:03:00.750 --> 00:03:01.810
CHAPTER 36

00:03:02.350 --> 00:03:06.750
THE TRANSFORM ALL JAPANESE YOKAI PROJECT

00:03:07.690 --> 00:03:09.740
The Ring of Arcana...?

00:03:12.950 --> 00:03:14.970
No way.

00:03:14.970 --> 00:03:18.200
It'd never just be lying here.

00:03:26.550 --> 00:03:28.960
I can try it on a bit, right?

00:03:35.260 --> 00:03:37.600
It's so pretty.

00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:41.940
It's a lovely ring. Such a shame...

00:03:46.230 --> 00:03:47.500
Huh?

00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:49.840
I-It won't come off.

00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:51.590
H-Huh?

00:03:51.590 --> 00:03:55.720
What should I do? I can't get it off.

00:03:55.720 --> 00:04:01.640
<i>Ripen, ripen, ripen, ripen
Ripen and fester</i>

00:04:02.120 --> 00:04:06.650
<i>The ring that can't be removed
It belongs to the witches</i>

00:04:06.650 --> 00:04:09.700
<i>A ring that only witches can remove</i>

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:14.970
<i>Of course a human could never get it off</i>

00:04:15.570 --> 00:04:19.160
Oh man. What should I do?

00:04:20.620 --> 00:04:22.180
Human child.

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:26.670
Give me that ring.

00:04:28.070 --> 00:04:30.550
Are you... Adele?

00:04:31.190 --> 00:04:32.670
You know my name?

00:04:35.780 --> 00:04:36.740
Stop!

00:04:40.600 --> 00:04:42.910
Spirit Hair Chanchanko!

00:04:46.060 --> 00:04:47.860
It's Agnes' sister!

00:04:47.860 --> 00:04:49.310
I know.

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:52.450
Dad, look after Mana.

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:54.170
Right. Got it.

00:04:55.260 --> 00:04:59.330
Hey, Kitaro. Don't underestimate her!

00:04:59.330 --> 00:05:00.910
Yes, Dad!

00:05:00.910 --> 00:05:02.600
Mana, take this.

00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:06.590
Mana-chan, hurry to the GeGeGe Forest.

00:05:06.590 --> 00:05:09.880
Sand Witch and the others are there!

00:05:09.880 --> 00:05:11.250
Got it!

00:05:13.610 --> 00:05:17.010
But, I thought humans can't enter
the GeGeGe Forest.

00:05:17.010 --> 00:05:18.470
Don't worry.

00:05:18.470 --> 00:05:22.230
You're wearing the <i>chanchanko</i>
woven from our ancestors' spirit hair.

00:05:22.230 --> 00:05:26.040
Just get to the GeGeGe Forest!

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:28.330
<i>Kitaro.</i>

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:30.750
<i>Good luck.</i>

00:05:31.670 --> 00:05:35.110
Does that girl know Agnes?

00:05:35.110 --> 00:05:38.120
Yeah. She's probably her friend.

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:41.120
A friend? A human child is her friend?

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:44.460
A witch and a human child
could never become friends.

00:05:44.460 --> 00:05:49.020
It's that sort of prejudice
that's making Agnes miserable.

00:05:49.350 --> 00:05:51.320
Miserable?

00:05:53.050 --> 00:05:57.610
What do you...
What do you know of witches?!

00:05:59.050 --> 00:06:00.470
Hair Needles!

00:06:01.470 --> 00:06:03.330
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:16.010
Give it up, Adele.

00:06:31.480 --> 00:06:32.610
Stop.

00:06:42.510 --> 00:06:44.330
Give me that ring!

00:06:51.400 --> 00:06:53.940
Leave this to me and go!

00:06:53.940 --> 00:06:57.150
Okay! Thank you, Old Man Crybaby-san!

00:06:58.840 --> 00:06:59.970
Stop!

00:07:01.260 --> 00:07:04.350
I wanted to make you my bride.

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:09.660
Wally Wall!

00:07:10.960 --> 00:07:13.340
Mana, hurry.

00:07:13.340 --> 00:07:15.730
Wally Wall-san, thank you!

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:18.880
Stop.

00:07:21.110 --> 00:07:26.540
Little girl, let's have
the Ring of Arcana.

00:07:27.180 --> 00:07:28.470
Finger and all!

00:07:34.290 --> 00:07:35.730
Are you all right, Mana?

00:07:35.730 --> 00:07:38.150
Cat-san, thank you!

00:07:38.150 --> 00:07:40.900
We meet again, little girl.

00:07:41.590 --> 00:07:43.990
We meet again, old hag.

00:07:43.990 --> 00:07:45.740
What?

00:07:45.740 --> 00:07:47.970
Old hag?!

00:07:53.440 --> 00:07:56.300
Mana-chan, it's just a little further!
Keep it up!

00:07:56.300 --> 00:07:57.820
Human child.

00:07:58.210 --> 00:07:59.220
Adele!

00:07:59.220 --> 00:08:04.220
If you know Agnes,
then you know what that ring represents.

00:08:04.220 --> 00:08:07.980
Agnes doesn't want the Brigadoon Project!

00:08:07.980 --> 00:08:11.430
What my sister does or doesn't want
is irrelevant.

00:08:11.430 --> 00:08:12.390
What?

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:15.750
It's a witch's fate.

00:08:25.990 --> 00:08:27.620
Mana, raise your hand!

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:34.750
This is the Sand Drum!

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:39.550
Oh no!

00:08:42.990 --> 00:08:44.720
Kitaro-san!

00:08:44.720 --> 00:08:46.640
Hey, hold on!

00:08:46.640 --> 00:08:49.140
What happened, Kitaro-san?

00:08:49.660 --> 00:08:54.230
Agnes, can you do something about
the Ring of Arcana?

00:08:54.230 --> 00:08:55.360
It won't come off.

00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:57.020
I'll take care of it later!

00:08:57.020 --> 00:09:00.820
For now, getting out of here is
more important!

00:09:06.840 --> 00:09:08.740
I can't control it!

00:09:10.220 --> 00:09:11.120
Mana!

00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:23.490
A-Adele!

00:09:33.370 --> 00:09:36.480
What are you doing?! Give it back!

00:09:36.870 --> 00:09:38.980
-Give it back! Give it back!
-Be quiet!

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:40.980
-Give that back!
-Stop struggling!

00:09:40.980 --> 00:09:42.780
Give it back!

00:09:47.680 --> 00:09:48.830
Mana!

00:09:48.830 --> 00:09:51.560
Come on! Move, move!

00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:53.210
It moved!

00:09:53.210 --> 00:09:54.180
Mana!

00:09:58.170 --> 00:09:59.610
Mana!

00:10:14.850 --> 00:10:15.770
Agnes!

00:10:15.770 --> 00:10:17.350
Mana!

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:21.380
Mana!

00:10:32.300 --> 00:10:33.640
Agnes.

00:10:34.930 --> 00:10:36.390
Adele.

00:10:43.340 --> 00:10:45.550
Finger Guns!

00:10:48.490 --> 00:10:50.240
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:10:53.160 --> 00:10:54.510
Adele!

00:11:03.790 --> 00:11:05.340
Backbeard-sama!

00:11:06.570 --> 00:11:08.220
Falling cotton...

00:11:14.850 --> 00:11:17.080
FIGHTING WITH WESTERN <i>YOKAI</i>!

00:11:17.890 --> 00:11:21.580
BACKBEARD
HAHAHAHAHAHA

00:11:19.640 --> 00:11:20.520
-<i>"Oh, what should I do?"</i>
<i>-"I was sleeping."</i>

00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:21.520
<i>"Huh?!"</i>

00:11:28.050 --> 00:11:32.510
Kitaro can no longer get in the way of
my Brigadoon.

00:11:32.510 --> 00:11:34.180
Backbeard-sama.

00:11:34.180 --> 00:11:36.350
You disappoint me, Adele.

00:11:36.350 --> 00:11:41.310
You were so desperate to get the ring back
you let Kitaro get the better of you.

00:11:41.310 --> 00:11:43.020
Forgive me.

00:11:43.020 --> 00:11:45.340
It matters not.

00:11:46.300 --> 00:11:50.110
I have the Ring of Arcana and Agnes now.

00:11:50.550 --> 00:11:55.010
At last the Brigadoon Project
can commence.

00:12:08.860 --> 00:12:13.240
No! I'll never be the core!

00:12:18.580 --> 00:12:19.870
Agnes?!

00:12:20.850 --> 00:12:23.350
You persistent old hag!

00:12:25.750 --> 00:12:28.800
Dammit! It's an emergency!

00:12:35.720 --> 00:12:39.280
Soon the Brigadoon shall begin!

00:12:43.560 --> 00:12:49.550
Adele, make Agnes the core
and begin the Brigadoon.

00:12:49.550 --> 00:12:52.800
As you command, Backbeard-sama.

00:12:54.910 --> 00:13:00.560
Agnes, did you really think you could
escape a witch's fate?

00:13:00.560 --> 00:13:03.080
Fate and destiny...

00:13:03.390 --> 00:13:07.650
That's all that's important to you.
I hate you, Adele!

00:13:11.340 --> 00:13:12.800
You hate me...

00:13:14.010 --> 00:13:15.090
I see...

00:13:39.740 --> 00:13:43.580
<i>Rantsai wana keiku kodami de</i>

00:13:44.450 --> 00:13:46.750
<i>Brigadoon!</i>

00:13:59.510 --> 00:14:00.870
Agnes...

00:14:02.350 --> 00:14:03.720
Adele?

00:14:04.350 --> 00:14:05.620
Why?

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:09.860
You alone should escape
the binds of being a witch.

00:14:11.320 --> 00:14:15.840
I'm sure Mother would have wanted that.

00:14:16.950 --> 00:14:18.490
Do you remember?

00:14:19.030 --> 00:14:23.160
The time we made flower crowns for Mother.

00:14:34.570 --> 00:14:38.760
Were you the one who just used magic?

00:14:40.470 --> 00:14:45.020
In that moment,
Backbeard-sama chose you...

00:14:45.890 --> 00:14:47.870
as the core of the Brigadoon!

00:14:49.850 --> 00:14:52.170
I realized then...

00:14:52.170 --> 00:14:57.070
that I was destined to lose not only
my mother, but my sister as well.

00:15:11.580 --> 00:15:13.250
Our mother...

00:15:13.250 --> 00:15:20.130
intended for the role of witches
to end with her generation.

00:15:21.050 --> 00:15:23.910
But, oh cruel fate...

00:15:23.910 --> 00:15:26.600
you had the potential as a witch.

00:15:28.060 --> 00:15:33.770
And it was discovered by Backbeard-sama.

00:15:36.690 --> 00:15:41.850
In order to save your life,
I had to obey Backbeard-sama's will

00:15:41.850 --> 00:15:45.660
and play the family reputation-obsessed
older sister.

00:15:45.930 --> 00:15:47.930
A-Adele...

00:15:48.580 --> 00:15:51.460
Th-This is as it should be.

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:58.940
This way, the world Backbeard-sama wants
will come to pass.

00:15:59.590 --> 00:16:00.800
This way...

00:16:01.760 --> 00:16:04.090
you can be free.

00:16:11.770 --> 00:16:13.460
Sister...

00:16:16.570 --> 00:16:18.960
After all I've done...

00:16:19.740 --> 00:16:22.970
you still call me sister?

00:16:22.970 --> 00:16:26.720
Why do I have to lose my family?!

00:16:27.660 --> 00:16:32.180
Would you have me bear that pain?

00:16:36.540 --> 00:16:38.210
Sister!

00:16:41.010 --> 00:16:42.930
The fate of witches...

00:16:44.200 --> 00:16:47.470
shall end with me.

00:16:54.710 --> 00:16:59.610
I wasn't able to save Mana.

00:17:00.900 --> 00:17:02.070
Now...

00:17:02.860 --> 00:17:04.400
my sister...

00:17:05.380 --> 00:17:09.200
Can't I save her?

00:17:11.830 --> 00:17:13.930
Wh-Why?

00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:25.430
Did you think I didn't realize you'd try
to sacrifice yourself for Agnes?

00:17:26.660 --> 00:17:30.910
You're useless and could never match up to
your mother or sister.

00:17:31.470 --> 00:17:35.790
You would be the core of the Brigadoon
in Agnes' place?

00:17:35.790 --> 00:17:38.920
Did you think you possessed such magic?

00:17:39.520 --> 00:17:42.190
You're but a diligent older sister.

00:17:42.570 --> 00:17:47.680
A fool who could only try to make up for
their lack of magic with effort.

00:17:48.570 --> 00:17:54.710
No matter what, you're nothing but
a tool to make Agnes the core.

00:17:56.190 --> 00:17:57.310
Sister!

00:17:57.310 --> 00:17:59.750
Now, Agnes.

00:18:00.190 --> 00:18:05.200
If you wish to save your sister's life,
begin the Brigadoon Project.

00:18:05.200 --> 00:18:07.320
Don't, Agnes!

00:18:07.320 --> 00:18:13.390
Will you abandon your kind sister
who tried to take your place?

00:18:14.450 --> 00:18:17.270
Then how about this?

00:18:19.650 --> 00:18:20.630
Kitaro!

00:18:20.630 --> 00:18:23.570
So, what will it be?!

00:18:25.300 --> 00:18:26.800
Sister! Kitaro!

00:18:36.390 --> 00:18:38.290
This is the end!

00:18:39.310 --> 00:18:40.440
Stop!

00:18:42.670 --> 00:18:43.920
Please...

00:18:44.550 --> 00:18:49.840
Don't hurt my sister or Kitaro anymore.

00:18:50.450 --> 00:18:53.010
Was that an order?

00:18:56.770 --> 00:19:03.730
Please, if you would,
don't hurt my sister or Kitaro anymore.

00:19:04.650 --> 00:19:09.680
"I beg of you, Backbeard-sama."

00:19:10.990 --> 00:19:15.520
I beg of you, Backbeard-sama...

00:19:15.520 --> 00:19:18.180
Is that your will?

00:19:21.420 --> 00:19:24.940
Then you know what to do.

00:19:27.800 --> 00:19:31.260
Good. Stand up, Agnes.

00:19:45.270 --> 00:19:48.210
Now put on the ring.

00:19:58.410 --> 00:19:59.890
Agnes...

00:20:08.170 --> 00:20:10.800
<i>Sister... Kitaro...</i>

00:20:11.380 --> 00:20:12.820
<i>For me...</i>

00:20:14.180 --> 00:20:15.430
Forgive me.

00:20:21.640 --> 00:20:25.830
Now cast the spell, core of the Brigadoon!

00:20:28.650 --> 00:20:32.490
<i>Rantsai wana keiku kodami de</i>

00:20:33.590 --> 00:20:35.660
<i>Brigadoon!</i>

00:21:00.100 --> 00:21:02.620
Ah! The Brigadoon has begun!

00:21:02.620 --> 00:21:05.620
Wally Wa...

00:21:13.010 --> 00:21:17.010
Now Japan belongs to Backbeard-sama!

00:21:36.220 --> 00:21:40.350
<i>At last the Brigadoon has begun</i>

00:21:40.470 --> 00:21:45.020
<i>All go mad
Everyone goes mad</i>

00:21:45.140 --> 00:21:50.070
<i>Spinning, spinning, spinning into madness</i>

00:21:50.190 --> 00:21:54.820
<i>Madness is simple
Madness is paradise</i>

00:21:54.950 --> 00:22:02.080
<i>All fall equally
To the darkness of madness</i>

00:22:06.620 --> 00:22:10.500
<i>mien keredomo orundayo</i>

00:22:06.620 --> 00:22:10.500
<i>You can't see them
But they're there</i>

00:22:12.050 --> 00:22:14.340
<i>yama de yahho</i>

00:22:12.050 --> 00:22:14.340
<i>"Hello" in the mountains</i>

00:22:14.460 --> 00:22:17.260
<i>hitokoe yobeba</i>

00:22:14.460 --> 00:22:17.260
<i>If you call</i>

00:22:17.380 --> 00:22:19.550
<i>onaji yahho</i>

00:22:17.380 --> 00:22:19.550
<i>An identical "Hello"</i>

00:22:19.680 --> 00:22:24.850
<i>yobuko ga kaesu</i>

00:22:19.680 --> 00:22:24.850
<i>The Yobuko calls back</i>

00:22:25.180 --> 00:22:27.440
<i>yama ni sunderu ki no seirei</i>

00:22:25.180 --> 00:22:27.440
<i>A tree spirit living in the mountains</i>

00:22:30.650 --> 00:22:32.860
<i>tsukatta zoukin</i>

00:22:30.650 --> 00:22:32.860
<i>A used rag</i>

00:22:32.980 --> 00:22:35.740
<i>kirei ni shinaito</i>

00:22:32.980 --> 00:22:35.740
<i>If you don't keep it clean</i>

00:22:35.990 --> 00:22:38.110
<i>kusaku nattayo</i>

00:22:35.990 --> 00:22:38.110
<i>It'll get smelly</i>

00:22:38.240 --> 00:22:43.490
<i>shirouneri karamitsuku</i>

00:22:38.240 --> 00:22:43.490
<i>The Shiro-Uneri
Will tangle itself around you</i>

00:22:43.790 --> 00:22:46.040
<i>kao ni bettori korya tamaran</i>

00:22:43.790 --> 00:22:46.040
<i>Stuck to your face
How horrible</i>

00:22:46.160 --> 00:22:51.540
<i>konnani oruyo obaketachi</i>

00:22:46.160 --> 00:22:51.540
